## Techniques Used by Function Type

| Function Type      | Technique              | Description                        |
|--------------------|------------------------|------------------------------------|
| Classification      | Support Vector Machines | A supervised learning model used for classification tasks. |
| Regression          | Linear Regression       | A method to model the relationship between a dependent variable and one or more independent variables.  |
| Clustering          | K-Means Clustering      | An algorithm that aims to partition n observations into k clusters in which each observation belongs to the cluster with the nearest mean. |
| Dimensionality Reduction | Principal Component Analysis | A technique used to emphasize variation and bring out strong patterns in a dataset. |
